# bench/live/parity.mjs's raw recoverable-live captures, the gzip files it writes in its default
# output (each case's and fan-out's .json.gz, and source.diff.gz). Its coverage.json, plan.json and
# other JSON stay visible. Committed evidence is a summary whose provenance records where a
# maintainer published the captures and their SHA-256 (CONTRIBUTING.md, Benchmark results).
/results/**/*.gz
